{"path":"/case-studies/k2-group/","slug":"case-studies__k2-group","kind":"case-study","title":"K2 Group Case Study: Turning a Six-Site Estate into the Answer AI Engines Give | Legency Media","description":"K2 Group is a global mobility group: specialist relocation, immigration, advisory and communications businesses under one roof. The estate runs on six Webflow sites, a group hub plus brands covering everyday relocation, bespoke moves for executives and families, immigration and cross-border work, mobility advisory, and the group's foundation. Six sites means six content libraries, six templates, and six places for search to go wrong.","source":"live","stylesheets":["/_astro/global.Btqt_PqA.css","/_astro/Base.D9X9tJbq.css","/_astro/ConsentBanner.Bjqg_HPr.css","/_astro/_slug_.CjSPQXea.css"],"scripts":["/_astro/Nav.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BTi8Y4C0.js","/_astro/Footer.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.QLgbxcz6.js","/_astro/ConsentBanner.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BlWZOVqD.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_0_lang.BUtqXeGZ.js","/_astro/Base.astro_astro_type_script_index_1_lang.s69FG7Vr.js"],"mainHtml":"<section class=\"cs-hero\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container cs-hero__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"cs-hero__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Case Study</span><span class=\"cs-hero__client\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"cs-hero__logo\" src=\"/img/partners/k2-group.svg\" alt=\"K2 Group\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y></span><h1 class=\"cs-hero__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Turning a Six-Site Estate into the Answer AI Engines Give</h1><aside class=\"side-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"side-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h2 data-no-roll class=\"side-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Our role</h2><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"side-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Three of four AI assistants now name K2 for executive relocation. One partner runs search across the group’s six-site estate, with one board report.</p></aside></div><figure class=\"cs-hero__media\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><img class=\"case-visual\" src=\"/img/case-studies/k2-photo-1440.webp\" srcset=\"/img/case-studies/k2-photo-800.webp 800w, /img/case-studies/k2-photo-1440.webp 1440w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 94vw, 45vw\" alt=\"K2 Group homepage on a MacBook in a sunlit airport lounge.\" width=\"1440\" height=\"1008\" loading=\"eager\" decoding=\"async\" data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr><figcaption data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>K2 Group. Search and website improvements across an existing Webflow estate.</figcaption></figure></div><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dl class=\"cs-stats\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>search impressions, five sites, May to Sep 2026</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>+42%</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>K2 X Border impressions</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>+375%</dd></div><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><dt data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>AI assistants name K2 for VIP moves</dt><dd data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>3 of 4</dd></div></dl></div></section><section class=\"challenge\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container challenge__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Challenge</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"challenge__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Six websites, one brand, and search working against itself.</h2></div><div class=\"challenge__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>K2 Group is a global mobility group: specialist relocation, immigration, advisory and communications businesses under one roof. The estate runs on six Webflow sites, a group hub plus brands covering everyday relocation, bespoke moves for executives and families, immigration and cross-border work, mobility advisory, and the group&#39;s foundation. Six sites means six content libraries, six templates, and six places for search to go wrong.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A move away from the group&#39;s old domain had left rankings behind. Service-level searches never made the jump to the new sites, and roughly 261 ranked URLs were stranded on a domain the business no longer used.</p><p data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The previous agency leaned on automated tools. K2 wanted a different shape of partnership: one partner taking full ownership across every site, a direct relationship, and a bias toward action. It also wanted to get ahead of AI-driven search. When a buyer asks an AI engine who handles a discreet executive move, K2 needed to be the name in the answer.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"solution section\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container solution__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"solution__lead\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Solution</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"solution__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Running six sites as one system.</h2></div><div class=\"solution__cards\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Estate-Wide Ownership</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>One partner handles the whole estate: Webflow builds, technical search work and AI visibility across all six sites, run as a single system with shared standards rather than six separate projects. K2&#39;s security team ran a 36-question cyber due diligence questionnaire and a client-side MSA before the work began.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Read Everything, Then Write Less</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M20 12V5.74853C20 5.5894 19.9368 5.43679 19.8243 5.32426L16.6757 2.17574C16.5632 2.06321 16.4106 2 16.2515 2H4.6C4.26863 2 4 2.26863 4 2.6V21.4C4 21.7314 4.26863 22 4.6 22H11\"/><path d=\"M8 10H16M8 6H12M8 14H11\"/><path d=\"M17.9541 16.9394L18.9541 15.9394C19.392 15.5015 20.102 15.5015 20.5399 15.9394V15.9394C20.9778 16.3773 20.9778 17.0873 20.5399 17.5252L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L14.963 19.9305C14.8131 20.0804 14.7147 20.2741 14.6821 20.4835L14.4394 22.0399L15.9957 21.7973C16.2052 21.7646 16.3988 21.6662 16.5487 21.5163L19.5399 18.5252M17.9541 16.9394L19.5399 18.5252\"/><path d=\"M16 2V5.4C16 5.73137 16.2686 6 16.6 6H20\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Every article on all six sites was read. 196 posts passed the mechanical test and only 53 survived the editorial one: would somebody type this into a search engine without ever having heard of K2? That produced 205 new answers, each grounded in its own article, with no figure, date or threshold invented.</p></article><article class=\"sol-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"sol-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"sol-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Repair Work Underneath</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9.00001 21L8.00001 21C6.89544 21 6.00001 20.1057 6.00001 19.0011C6.00001 17.4501 6.00001 15.3443 6 14C6 13 4.5 12 4.5 12C4.5 12 6.00001 11 6.00001 10C6.00001 8.827 6.00001 6.62207 6.00001 4.99914C6.00001 3.89457 6.89544 3 8.00001 3L9.00001 3\"/><path d=\"M15 21L16 21C17.1046 21 18 20.1057 18 19.0011C18 17.4501 18 15.3443 18 14C18 13 19.5 12 19.5 12C19.5 12 18 11 18 10C18 8.827 18 6.62207 18 4.99914C18 3.89457 17.1046 3 16 3L15 3\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"sol-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Technical health rose on all five sites measured in the first month, by 5 to 10 points each. 230 markup errors were closed across the estate. 63 of the 75 links still pointing at the retired brand domain were repaired, and 40 internal links were placed from a map of 176 built by reading 153 articles.</p></article></div></div></section><section class=\"outcome\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"container\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"outcome__head\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><span class=\"label label--on-dark\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The Outcome</span><h2 data-no-roll class=\"outcome__title\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The name AI engines give for VIP relocation.</h2></div><div class=\"outcome__grid\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Search Impressions Up 42%</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M5.21173 15.1113L2.52473 12.4243C2.29041 12.1899 2.29041 11.8101 2.52473 11.5757L5.21173 8.88873C5.44605 8.65442 5.82595 8.65442 6.06026 8.88873L8.74727 11.5757C8.98158 11.8101 8.98158 12.1899 8.74727 12.4243L6.06026 15.1113C5.82595 15.3456 5.44605 15.3456 5.21173 15.1113Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 21.475L8.88874 18.788C8.65443 18.5537 8.65443 18.1738 8.88874 17.9395L11.5757 15.2525C11.8101 15.0182 12.19 15.0182 12.4243 15.2525L15.1113 17.9395C15.3456 18.1738 15.3456 18.5537 15.1113 18.788L12.4243 21.475C12.19 21.7094 11.8101 21.7094 11.5757 21.475Z\"/><path d=\"M11.5757 8.7475L8.88874 6.06049C8.65443 5.82618 8.65443 5.44628 8.88874 5.21197L11.5757 2.52496C11.8101 2.29065 12.19 2.29065 12.4243 2.52496L15.1113 5.21197C15.3456 5.44628 15.3456 5.82618 15.1113 6.06049L12.4243 8.7475C12.19 8.98181 11.8101 8.98181 11.5757 8.7475Z\"/><path d=\"M17.9396 15.1113L15.2526 12.4243C15.0183 12.1899 15.0183 11.8101 15.2526 11.5757L17.9396 8.88873C18.174 8.65442 18.5539 8.65442 18.7882 8.88873L21.4752 11.5757C21.7095 11.8101 21.7095 12.1899 21.4752 12.4243L18.7882 15.1113C18.5539 15.3456 18.174 15.3456 17.9396 15.1113Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Search impressions across five K2 websites rose from 24,822 in May 2026 to 35,245 in September. K2 X Border grew from 595 to 2,825 and K2 Relocate from 3,383 to 6,437 over the same months.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Three of Four Engines Name K2</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 12.5C17.2761 12.5 17.5 12.2761 17.5 12C17.5 11.7239 17.2761 11.5 17 11.5C16.7239 11.5 16.5 11.7239 16.5 12C16.5 12.2761 16.7239 12.5 17 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 12.5C12.2761 12.5 12.5 12.2761 12.5 12C12.5 11.7239 12.2761 11.5 12 11.5C11.7239 11.5 11.5 11.7239 11.5 12C11.5 12.2761 11.7239 12.5 12 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M7 12.5C7.27614 12.5 7.5 12.2761 7.5 12C7.5 11.7239 7.27614 11.5 7 11.5C6.72386 11.5 6.5 11.7239 6.5 12C6.5 12.2761 6.72386 12.5 7 12.5Z\" fill=\"currentColor\"/><path d=\"M12 22C17.5228 22 22 17.5228 22 12C22 6.47715 17.5228 2 12 2C6.47715 2 2 6.47715 2 12C2 13.8214 2.48697 15.5291 3.33782 17L2.5 21.5L7 20.6622C8.47087 21.513 10.1786 22 12 22Z\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Twenty buyer questions went to ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini and Claude on 31 July 2026 with web search enabled: 80 answers, and the group&#39;s first baseline. Asked which providers handle executive and VIP moves discreetly, three of the four engines cited K2. That is one answer owned outright.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>FAQ Library, 244 to 449</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M10 12H5C4.44772 12 4 11.5523 4 11V7.5C4 6.94772 4.44772 6.5 5 6.5H9C9.55228 6.5 10 6.94772 10 7.5V12ZM10 12C10 14.5 9 16 6 17.5\"/><path d=\"M20 12H15C14.4477 12 14 11.5523 14 11V7.5C14 6.94772 14.4477 6.5 15 6.5H19C19.5523 6.5 20 6.94772 20 7.5V12ZM20 12C20 14.5 19 16 16 17.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>205 new answers across the estate, each attached to the article it belongs to. 75 of them run in French, Spanish, Portuguese and Mandarin. Regulatory content stayed in English deliberately, because visa thresholds and tax treatment carry real risk if a translation drifts.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A Legacy Domain Retired Properly</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M17 20V4M17 4L20 7M17 4L14 7\"/><path d=\"M7 4V20M7 20L10 17M7 20L4 17\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>The old domain fell from 103 ranked terms to 3, and the group&#39;s brand search moved to first place on the live site. 261 stranded URLs were mapped to the brand destinations that should own them.</p></article><article class=\"out-card\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><div class=\"out-card__top\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y><h3 class=\"out-card__heading\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>Board-Grade Monthly Reporting</h3><span class=\"icon-chip icon-chip--muted\" style=\"--icon-chip-size:44px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga><path d=\"M9 21H15M9 21V16M9 21H3.6C3.26863 21 3 20.7314 3 20.4V16.6C3 16.2686 3.26863 16 3.6 16H9M15 21V9M15 21H20.4C20.7314 21 21 20.7314 21 20.4V3.6C21 3.26863 20.7314 3 20.4 3H15.6C15.2686 3 15 3.26863 15 3.6V9M15 9H9.6C9.26863 9 9 9.26863 9 9.6V16\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/></svg></span></div><p class=\"out-card__text\" data-astro-cid-f4yest4y>A monthly report covers traffic, keywords, authority, AI visibility and the technical work delivered, per site. Every number names its source, work delivered is kept separate from work expected, and it is built to go straight to the board.</p></article></div></div></section>","inlineStyles":[".transition {\n          display: none;\n        }",".cs-hero .label,.challenge .label,.solution .label,.work-hero .label{color:#625e5e}.site-footer .closer__scene{filter:grayscale()}.case-visual[data-astro-cid-iavcwzwr]{width:100%;height:auto;display:block}\n.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);height:var(--icon-chip-size,48px);background:var(--blue);color:var(--white);border-radius:var(--radius-sm);flex-shrink:0;place-items:center;display:grid}.icon-chip--on-dark[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{background:#ffffff1a;border:1px solid #ffffff47}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:inherit;background:0 0;border:0}.icon-chip--muted[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{color:#201d1d8c;background:#201d1d0f;border:1px solid #201d1d1a}.icon-chip[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:58%;height:58%;display:block}.icon-chip--bare[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga] svg[data-astro-cid-ccg5yoga]{width:100%;height:100%}","html.lenis,html.lenis body{height:auto}.lenis:not(.lenis-autoToggle).lenis-stopped{overflow:clip}.lenis [data-lenis-prevent],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-wheel],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-touch],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-vertical],.lenis [data-lenis-prevent-horizontal]{overscroll-behavior:contain}.lenis.lenis-smooth iframe{pointer-events:none}.lenis.lenis-autoToggle{transition-behavior:allow-discrete;transition-property:overflow;transition-duration:1ms}"]}